Error [E0025]: Jet doesn't use `unwrap`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_unwrap.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     unwrap;
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: when failure should stop the program, use `or panic("…")`
 Fix: write `parse(x) or panic("…")` instead of `.unwrap()`

Error [E0003]: expected a value, found `;`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_unwrap.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     unwrap;
    |           ^
 Why: a value can be a name, a number, quoted text, `true`/`false`, or a call
 Fix: e.g. `x`, `42`, `3.5`, or `"hello"`
